 ## Guidance
 
-**Observed:** Settings, Files, Messages, and Shortcuts used rounded Search fields with leading magnifiers and trailing microphones, but placement varied. Focused Settings search retained exit/clear behavior; a temporary unmatched query produced centered feedback and clearing restored content. **Inferred adaptation:** keep placement stable within one screen, distinguish zero matches from failure, echo a query when useful, and retain reset/exit. Dictation, Safari focus, loading, and network/indexing failures remain **Unconfirmed**.
+**Observed:** Settings, Files, Messages, and Shortcuts used rounded Search fields with leading magnifiers and trailing microphones, but placement varied. Focused Settings search retained exit/clear behavior; a temporary unmatched query produced centered feedback and clearing restored content. Focused-empty-before-query appearance is uncaptured. **Inferred adaptation:** keep placement stable within one screen, distinguish zero matches from failure, echo a query when useful, and retain reset/exit. Dictation, Safari focus, loading, and network/indexing failures remain **Unconfirmed**.
 
